jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – After redshirt senior forward Saige Wimes' 90th-minute goal, the No. 9-ranked West Virginia University women's soccer team tallied a 1-1 draw with No. 12 Baylor in its Big 12 Conference opener in Morgantown on Friday night.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/9/18/ex1-5__2_.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/9/18/ex1-5__2_.jpg"><media:title>Members of the WVU women's soccer team celebrate after a goal.</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/9/18/ex1-5__2_.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Fri, 18 Sep 2026 23:07:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>13</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59414</s:story_id></item><item><title>Mountaineers Open Sun Belt Play With Win Over Georgia State</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/9/17/mens-soccer-mountaineers-open-sun-belt-play-with-win-over-georgia-state</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/9/17/mens-soccer-mountaineers-open-sun-belt-play-with-win-over-georgia-state</guid><category>Men's Soccer</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="Harry Hogben" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/9/17/FB_WVUvsUTMartin_Sept12_2026_TT-1-2.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. (Sept. 17, 2026) – The West Virginia University men's soccer team opened Sun Belt action with a 1-0 victory over Georgia State, Thursday evening at Dick Dlesk Soccer Stadium. The Mountaineers improve to 4-1-1 overall and 1-0-0 in the Sun Belt while the Panthers fall to 5-2-1 and 0-1-0 in conference play. As the only Sun Belt game on the night, WVU currently sits atop the table.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/9/17/FB_WVUvsUTMartin_Sept12_2026_TT-1-2.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/9/17/FB_WVUvsUTMartin_Sept12_2026_TT-1-2.jpg"><media:title>Harry Hogben</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/9/17/FB_WVUvsUTMartin_Sept12_2026_TT-1-2.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Thu, 17 Sep 2026 22:26:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>6</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59411</s:story_id></item><item><title>Mountaineers Down East Texas A&amp;M in UNT Invitational Opener</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/9/17/volleyball-mountaineers-down-east-texas-am-in-unt-invitational-opener</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/9/17/volleyball-mountaineers-down-east-texas-am-in-unt-invitational-opener</guid><category>Volleyball</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="Macie Smith goes for kill against East Texas A&M" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/9/17/DSC05891.JPG" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – The West Virginia University volleyball team (5-3, 0-0 Big 12) opened the UNT Invitational with a 3-1 victory over East Texas A&M (6-5, 0-0 Southland) on Thursday afternoon at the UNT Volleyball Center.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/9/17/DSC05891.JPG" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/9/17/DSC05891.JPG"><media:title>Macie Smith goes for kill against East Texas A&amp;M</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path